{"id":"griffon","name":{"en":"Griffon","ja":"グリフォン","tc":"獅鷹","sc":"狮鹰"},"desc1":{"en":"This is a monster bird. If you get caughtin those talons, even your bones will break easily.","ja":"「鳥の魔物ね。あのかぎ爪に掴まれたら、　骨くらい簡単に折れちゃうわよ」","tc":"「這是鳥的魔物，被那個鉤爪抓住的話，　骨頭會很輕易地斷掉喔。」","sc":"“这是鸟的魔物，被那个钩爪抓住的话，　骨头很轻易就会断掉哦。”"},"desc2":{"en":"What?! O-ok! Let's beat it fromfar away, so we don't get caught!","ja":"「えっ！？よ、よし。掴まれないように　遠くから倒そう。ねっ！」","tc":"「咦！？好、好的。為了避免被抓到，　就從遠方打倒牠吧，就這麼辦！」","sc":"“咦！？好、好的。为了避免被抓到，　就从远方打倒它吧，就这么办！”"},"char1":"liane","char2":"firis","kind":"beast","hp":595,"atk":73,"defen":30,"spd":25,"level":29,"exp":159,"cole":100,"slash":3,"impact":3,"pierce":2,"magic":2,"fire":2,"ice":2,"light":1,"ail":2,"item_set":[{"id":"white-ashstone","name":{"en":"White Ashstone","ja":"白灰岩","tc":"石灰岩","sc":"石灰岩"}},{"id":"hakurei-stone","name":{"en":"Hakurei Stone","ja":"ハクレイ石","tc":"白冷石","sc":"白冷石"}},{"id":"crystal-shard","name":{"en":"Crystal Shard","ja":"水晶のかけら","tc":"水晶碎片","sc":"水晶碎片"}},{"id":"griffon-feather","name":{"en":"Griffon Feather","ja":"グリフォンの羽根","tc":"獅鷹的羽毛","sc":"狮鹰的羽毛"}},{"id":"tough-bone","name":{"en":"Tough Bone","ja":"丈夫な骨","tc":"堅韌骨頭","sc":"坚韧骨头"}},{"id":"pretty-shell","name":{"en":"Pretty Shell","ja":"きれいな貝殻","tc":"美麗貝殼","sc":"美丽贝壳"}},{"id":"sunny-bird-staff","name":{"en":"Sunny Bird Staff","ja":"鳥と陽の杖","tc":"鳥與陽之杖","sc":"鸟与阳之杖"}},{"id":"metal-slasher","name":{"en":"Metal Slasher","ja":"メタルスラッシャー","tc":"金屬切割刀","sc":"金属切割刀"}},{"id":"steel-bow","name":{"en":"Steel Bow","ja":"鋼鉄弓","tc":"鋼鐵弓","sc":"钢铁弓"}},{"id":"night-lightning","name":{"en":"Night Lightning","ja":"ナイトライトニング","tc":"暗夜雷光","sc":"暗夜雷光"}},{"id":"beast-warding-shirt","name":{"en":"Beast Warding Shirt","ja":"獣避けのシャツ","tc":"驅獸襯衫","sc":"驱兽衬衫"}},{"id":"combat-shirt","name":{"en":"Combat Shirt","ja":"コンバットシャツ","tc":"戰鬥襯衫","sc":"战斗衬衫"}}],"locations":[{"id":"claudel-prairie","name":{"en":"Claudel Prairie","ja":"クラーデル平原","tc":"吊鐘杯平原","sc":"吊钟杯平原"}},{"id":"southern-plains","name":{"en":"Southern Plains","ja":"南方原野","tc":